Horde NPC Inventory State Warlock
    Events
        Unit - A unit Acquires an item
        Unit - A unit Loses an item
        Unit - A unit Uses an item
    Conditions
        (Triggering unit) Equal to NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock is in Companion_Group.) Not equal to True
                (Current order of NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock) Not equal to (Order(attack))
                NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockBuy Not equal to True
                NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockSell Not equal to True
                NPC_Horde_AI_WarlockCamp Not equal to True
                And - All (Conditions) are true
                    Conditions
                        (Random integer number between 1 and 50) Equal to 1
                        (Item carried by NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock in slot 1) Equal to No item
                        (Item carried by NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock in slot 2) Equal to No item
                        (Item carried by NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock in slot 3) Equal to No item
                        (Item carried by NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock in slot 4) Equal to No item
                        (Item carried by NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock in slot 5) Equal to No item
                        (Item carried by NPC_Horde_AI_Warlock in slot 6) Equal to No item
            Then - Actions
                -------- =================================== --------
                -------- BUY ITEMS --------
                Trigger - Run Horde NPC Buy Items Warlock <gen> (checking conditions)
                Trigger - Turn on Horde NPC Buy Items Q Warlock <gen>
                Game - Display to (All players) the text: (Warlock + (MAIN STATE -  + buying items))
                -------- =================================== --------
            Else - Actions
